insert into public.locations (city,state,slug,heading,intro,content,image_url,active,sort_order,robots_index) select 'Gurgaon','Haryana','gurgaon','Pet Training In Gurgaon','A trained and groomed dog is one of the best gifts you can give to your family. After all, safety comes first, especially in a busy city like Gurgaon, where hectic schedules often leave pets craving attention and care. This is why professional dog training in Gurgaon becomes essential to help your dog stay obedient, communicative, calm, and well-behaved even when you are away for long hours. If you are searching for a trusted dog trainer in Gurgaon, Pawrexio offers customised solutions designed around your dog’s breed, age, personality, and behaviour.','[{"kind":"heading","text":"Professional Dog Trainer in Gurgaon for Customised Pet Services"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"A trained and groomed dog is one of the best gifts you can give to your family. After all, safety comes first, especially in a busy city like Gurgaon, where hectic schedules often leave pets craving attention and care. This is why professional dog training in Gurgaon becomes essential to help your dog stay obedient, communicative, calm, and well-behaved even when you are away for long hours. If you are searching for a trusted dog trainer in Gurgaon, Pawrexio offers customised solutions designed around your dog’s breed, age, personality, and behaviour."},{"kind":"heading","text":"How We Help | Pawrexio Loves Your Dog"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Our certified and experienced team provides personalised dog trainer in Gurgaon. Puppy obedience training, grooming, leash training, behaviour correction, home-visit sessions, advanced guard dog training - you name it. So whether you have a playful puppy or an adult dog with behavioural challenges, our trainers focus on building trust, discipline, and confidence in your pet."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Why Choose Our Pet Training Services in Gurgaon?"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Certified & Skilled Trainers: Professionals trained in handling all breeds and behavioural issues. Home-Visit Training: We train your pet at your home to ensure comfort and faster learning. Customised Training Programs: Tailored sessions based on your pet’s needs and goals. Positive Reinforcement: Completely reward-based and humane training techniques."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Our Pet Training Services"},{"kind":"heading","text":"1. Puppy Training (2–6 Months)"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Potty training Basic commands – Sit, Stay, Come Biting & chewing control Leash manners Social behaviour"},{"kind":"heading","text":"2. Basic Obedience Training"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Heel walk Recall training Stop, No, Stay commands Manners around visitors Calm behaviour in everyday situations"},{"kind":"heading","text":"3. Advanced Dog Training"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Off-leash training Agility & endurance exercises Task-based commands Guard & protection training (breed-specific)"},{"kind":"heading","text":"4. Behavioural Correction"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Aggressive behaviour Excessive barking Food/resource guarding Fear or anxiety issues Leash pulling Separation anxiety"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Benefits of Professional Dog Training"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Improved obedience and discipline Better social behaviour Reduced unwanted habits Stronger bond between owner and pet Safer and calmer home environment"},{"kind":"heading","text":"One Stop Solution for All Pet-parenting Problems"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Along with training, we also offer puppy grooming service Gurgaon to keep your furry companion healthy and happy. From dog grooming at home in Gurgaon to complete hygiene care, our dog training in Gurgaon services are designed for your convenience. If you have been googling for “pet training near me in Gurgaon” or a reliable “puppy grooming service in Gurgaon”, Pawrexio brings dog grooming at home Gurgaon with professional care right to your doorstep. Because your dog is not just a pet, they are family, deserving love, care, and a life full of happiness."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Book Pet Training in Gurgaon"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"We provide home-visit pet training across Gurgaon, including DLF, Golf Course Road, Sohna Road, MG Road, Sector 56, 57, 66, 70, New Gurgaon, and surrounding areas."}]','/assets/real/obedience.webp',true,0,true where not exists (select 1 from public.locations where slug='gurgaon');
insert into public.locations (city,state,slug,heading,intro,content,image_url,active,sort_order,robots_index) select 'Hyderabad','Telangana','hyderabad','Pet Training In Hyderabad','A well-trained furry friend makes everyday life feel easier, calmer, and more in control. But if you are a pet parent in Hyderabad, balancing a busy routine often means your pet may not get the attention, training, and structure they truly need. This is exactly where a professional dog trainer in Hyderabad becomes essential, helping your dog develop discipline, social behaviour, and emotional balance while fitting naturally into your lifestyle.','[{"kind":"heading","text":"Reliable, Personalised Pet Care Services | Dog Trainer in Hyderabad"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"A well-trained furry friend makes everyday life feel easier, calmer, and more in control. But if you are a pet parent in Hyderabad, balancing a busy routine often means your pet may not get the attention, training, and structure they truly need. This is exactly where a professional dog trainer in Hyderabad becomes essential, helping your dog develop discipline, social behaviour, and emotional balance while fitting naturally into your lifestyle."},{"kind":"heading","text":"“Unleash” a Happy Dog: Dog Walking Services in Hyderabad"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"At Pawrexio, our expert approach focuses on understanding your dog’s behaviour, breed, and personality to deliver effective results through structured and positive methods. Our services are designed to make training simple and stress-free for both pets and owners. Our certified dog trainer in Hyderabad team ensures consistent guidance and long-term behavioural improvement."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Complete Pet Training in Hyderabad for Your Furry Friends"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"We provide complete dog trainer in Hyderabad solutions including puppy training, leash training for dogs, obedience building, and behaviour correction. Whether you are raising a young puppy or managing an adult dog with challenges, our personalised training programs help build trust, discipline, and confidence in your pet. Along with this, we also offer essential pet training support and dog walking services to keep your pet active and balanced."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Pet Grooming & Cat Training Services at Affordable Prices"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"To support overall wellbeing, we provide basic Pet Grooming Services and convenient dog grooming at home in Hyderabad, ensuring hygiene and comfort without stress. If you are searching for a reliable dog trainer in Hyderabad, Pawrexio is here to help you raise a well-behaved, happy companion through expert care and consistent guidance."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Why Choose Our Pet Training Services in Hyderabad?"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Certified & Skilled Trainers: Professionals trained in handling all breeds and behavioural issues. Home-Visit Training: We train your pet at your home to ensure comfort and faster learning. Customised Training Programs: Tailored sessions based on your pet’s needs and goals. Positive Reinforcement: Completely reward-based and humane training techniques."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Our Pet Training Services"},{"kind":"heading","text":"1. Puppy Training (2–6 Months)"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Potty training Basic commands – Sit, Stay, Come Biting & chewing control Leash manners Social behaviour"},{"kind":"heading","text":"2. Basic Obedience Training"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Heel walk Recall training Stop, No, Stay commands Manners around visitors Calm behaviour in everyday situations"},{"kind":"heading","text":"3. Advanced Dog Training"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Off-leash training Agility & endurance exercises Task-based commands Guard & protection training (breed-specific)"},{"kind":"heading","text":"4. Behavioural Correction"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Aggressive behaviour Excessive barking Food/resource guarding Fear or anxiety issues Leash p