insert into public.locations (city,state,slug,heading,intro,content,image_url,active,sort_order,robots_index) select 'Ranchi','Jharkhand','ranchi','Pet Training in Ranchi','Ranchi is evolving into a modern city where pets are becoming an important part of family life. More pet parents are choosing to invest in the health, happiness, and overall well-being of their dogs and cats. With increasing awareness about responsible pet ownership, families are looking for reliable services that can help their pets live a balanced and fulfilling life. As the city''s pet-loving community continues to grow, the demand for quality training, grooming, and daily pet care services is also rising across Ranchi.','[{"kind":"heading","text":"Ranchi''s Growing Pet Community Is Creating a Need for Trusted Pet Care Services"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Ranchi is evolving into a modern city where pets are becoming an important part of family life. More pet parents are choosing to invest in the health, happiness, and overall well-being of their dogs and cats. With increasing awareness about responsible pet ownership, families are looking for reliable services that can help their pets live a balanced and fulfilling life. As the city''s pet-loving community continues to grow, the demand for quality training, grooming, and daily pet care services is also rising across Ranchi."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Why More Pet Parents Are Looking for a Professional Dog Trainer in Ranchi"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Training plays a major role in helping pets adapt to family life and city environments. From teaching basic manners to solving behavioural challenges, proper guidance can make a significant difference in a pet''s everyday life. A Professional Dog Trainer in Ranchi can help with Puppy Training , Pet Training , Leash Training for Dogs , socialisation, and behaviour management. Well-trained pets are easier to handle, more confident around people and other animals, and enjoy a stronger relationship with their owners. Training is not just about obedience; it is about creating better communication between pets and their families."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Pawrexio Brings Experience, Understanding, and Personalised Training for Every Pet"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"At Pawrexio, we understand that no two pets are the same. Every dog and cat has its own personality, learning style, and challenges. Our trainers use positive reinforcement methods that encourage learning through trust, patience, and consistency. Whether your pet needs Puppy Training , advanced obedience lessons, Cat Training Services , or support with behavioural issues, our team creates customised training plans designed around your pet''s unique needs. Our goal is to help pets become happy, confident, and well-mannered companions while making the training journey enjoyable for both pets and owners."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Why Choose Our Pet Training Services in Ranchi?"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Certified & Skilled Trainers: Professionals trained in handling all breeds and behavioural issues. Home-Visit Training: We train your pet at your home to ensure comfort and faster learning. Customised Training Programs: Tailored sessions based on your pet’s needs and goals. Positive Reinforcement: Completely reward-based and humane training techniques."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Our Pet Training Services"},{"kind":"heading","text":"1. Puppy Training (2–6 Months)"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Potty training Basic commands – Sit, Stay, Come Biting & chewing control Leash manners Social behaviour"},{"kind":"heading","text":"2. Basic Obedience Training"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Heel walk Recall training Stop, No, Stay commands Manners around visitors Calm behaviour in everyday situations"},{"kind":"heading","text":"3. Advanced Dog Training"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Off-leash training Agility & endurance exercises Task-based commands Guard & protection training (breed-specific)"},{"kind":"heading","text":"4. Behavioural Correction"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Aggressive behaviour Excessive barking Food/resource guarding Fear or anxiety issues Leash pulling Separation anxiety"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Benefits of Professional Dog Training"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Improved obedience and discipline Better social behaviour Reduced unwanted habits Stronger bond between owner and pet Safer and calmer home environment"},{"kind":"heading","text":"One Trusted Place for Pet Training, Grooming, Walking, and Complete Pet Care"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Pawrexio offers much more than training alone. We provide a complete range of services designed to support every stage of your pet''s life. From Dog Walking Services that keep your pet active and healthy to Pet Grooming Services and convenient Dog Grooming at Home options, we help pet parents manage their pets'' daily care with ease. By combining training, grooming, exercise, and behaviour support under one roof, Pawrexio serves as a trusted one-stop solution for pet owners who want the very best care for their beloved companions in Ranchi."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Book Pet Training in Ranchi"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"We provide home-visit pet training across Ranchi and surrounding areas."}]','/assets/real/obedience.webp',true,9,true where not exists (select 1 from public.locations where slug='ranchi');
insert into public.locations (city,state,slug,heading,intro,content,image_url,active,sort_order,robots_index) select 'Noida','Uttar Pradesh','noida','Pet Training in Noida','Life in Noida can get hectic, making it difficult to give your dog the time, exercise, and training they need every day. That''s where Pawrexio comes in with professional Pet Training in Noida and reliable daily dog walking services. Our experienced trainers create personalized training plans based on your dog''s age, breed, temperament, and learning pace, helping them stay active, disciplined, and happy even with a busy schedule.','[{"kind":"heading","text":"Pet Training in Noida"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Life in Noida can get hectic, making it difficult to give your dog the time, exercise, and training they need every day. That''s where Pawrexio comes in with professional Pet Training in Noida and reliable daily dog walking services. Our experienced trainers create personalized training plans based on your dog''s age, breed, temperament, and learning pace, helping them stay active, disciplined, and happy even with a busy schedule."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Many pet parents need more than just regular walks. If you''re looking for a trusted dog trainer in Noida , Pawrexio offers expert guidance for puppy training, obedience training, behaviour correction, and daily routine development. Our team also serves families searching for a dog trainer in Greater Noida , dog trainer in Ghaziabad , or dog trainer in Faridabad , providing professional support tailored to every dog''s unique needs."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Structured Urban Training | Dog Training in Noida"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"At Pawrexio, we provide practical Dog Training in Noida designed to suit modern urban lifestyles. Our structured training programs focus on improving obedience, communication, and social behaviour, helping dogs become calm, confident, and well-mannered in different environments. Along with dependable dog walking services, our trainers use positive reinforcement techniques to build healthy habits and strengthen the bond between pets and their owners. Whether you need a reliable dog trainer in Noida , Greater Noida , Ghaziabad , or Faridabad , our personalized dog obedience training in Noida helps dogs learn naturally in a comfortable and stress-free way."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Home-Based Expert Care | Home Dog Trainer in Noida"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Pawrexio offers personalized home training sessions for pet parents who prefer their dogs to learn in a familiar environment. Our home dog trainer in Noida service is perfect for teaching basic obedience, improving everyday behaviour, and correcting unwanted habits without the distractions of outdoor training facilities. Families across Noida, Greater Noida, Ghaziabad, and Faridabad trust our experienced trainers for consistent guidance, effective behaviour correction, and practical obedience training that makes everyday pet parenting easier and more enjoyable."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Why Choose Our Pet Training Services in Noida?"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Certified & Skilled Trainers: Experienced professionals trained to handle dogs of all breeds and behavioural needs."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Home-Visit Training: Convenient in-home sessions where your pet learns comfortably in a familiar environment."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Customized Training Programs: Every training plan is tailored according to your dog''s age, behaviour, and learning goals."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Positive Reinforcement: Reward-based and humane training methods that encourage long-term learning."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Our Pet Training Services"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"1. Puppy Training (2–6 Months)"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Potty training Basic commands – Sit, Stay, Come Biting & chewing control Leash manners Social behaviour and confidence building"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"2. Basic Obedience Training"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Heel walking Recall training Sit, Stay, Down & No commands Visitor manners Calm behaviour in everyday situations"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"3. Advanced Dog Training"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Off-leash obedience Agility & endurance exercises Task-based commands Guard & protection training (breed-specific)"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"4. Behavioural Correction"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Aggressive behaviour Excessive barking Food/resource guarding Fear or anxiety issues Leash pulling Separation anxiety"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Benefits of Professional Pet Training"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Professional pet training helps improve obedience and discipline, encourages better social behaviour, reduces unwanted habits, strengthens the bond between pets and their owners, and creates a safer, calmer, and happier home environment."},{"kind":"heading","text":"One Stop Solution for Pet Parents in Noida"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Along with professional pet training, Pawrexio also offers premium grooming and pet care services to keep your furry companion healthy and happy. From dog grooming at home in Noida to complete hygiene and wellness care, our services are designed for your convenience. If you''ve been searching for \"pet training near me in Noida\" or a trusted \"puppy grooming service in Noida\" , Pawrexio delivers expert care right to your doorstep. Because your dog is more than just a pet—they''re family and deserve the very best care."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Book Pet Training in Noida"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"We provide professional home-visit pet training across Noida, Greater Noida, Ghaziabad, Faridabad, Delhi, and nearby areas. Book your training session with Pawrexio today and help your dog become a happier, healthier, and better-behaved companion."}]','/assets/real/advanced-skills.webp',true,10,true where not exists (select 1 from public.locations where slug='noida');
insert into public.blog_posts (title,slug,excerpt,content,category,published_at,featured_image_url,status,robots_index) select 'Puppy Training: Build a Happy, Well-Behaved Companion','puppy-training-happy-well-behaved-companion','A practical guide to early routines, social confidence and the first skills your puppy needs.','Bringing home a puppy is exciting, but a thoughtful routine helps that excitement become a stable family life. Begin with predictable toilet breaks, meals, sleep and calm play.
insert into public.blog_posts (title,slug,excerpt,content,category,published_at,featured_image_url,status,robots_index) select 'Basic to Advanced Dog Training: Build Discipline From Day One','basic-to-advanced-dog-training','Understand how reliable behaviour develops from simple foundations to real-world fluency.','Advanced work is only as strong as the foundations beneath it. Clear markers, useful rewards and consistent household rules create a language the dog can understand.
insert into public.blog_posts (title,slug,excerpt,content,category,published_at,featured_image_url,status,robots_index) select 'Leash Training for Dogs: A Practical Guide','leash-training-practical-guide','Why dogs pull, how reinforcement shapes walking, and what makes calm leash skills last.','Pulling works because it often moves the dog toward something valuable. Training changes the pattern by making proximity, check-ins and a loose lead equally meaningful.
insert into public.blog_posts (title,slug,excerpt,content,category,published_at,featured_image_url,status,robots_index) select 'Dog Behaviour Training for Lasting Results','dog-behaviour-training-lasting-results','A behaviour-led approach to barking, fear, anxiety, reactivity and household challenges.','Behaviour communicates a need, emotion or learned expectation. Effective change starts by identifying what happens before and after the behaviour.
insert into public.blog_posts (title,slug,excerpt,content,category,published_at,featured_image_url,status,robots_index) select 'Cat Training for Better Home Habits','cat-training-home-habits','Use environment, choice and rewards to support litter, scratching and handling routines.','Cats learn continuously from their environment. Litter-box placement, substrate, cleanliness and access may matter as much as a training exercise.
